      "en": "JACQUES (Scene 13, turn 128): Creative fidelity is not the morbid preservation of the past: it is the victory of hope and communion beyond all temporal betrayals. We measure here the transcendence of authentic fidelity that surpasses the psychological idol to take root in immortal presence."
